182 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 146 0 R
/E (Most Applicant Tracking Systems screen resumes using exact keyword matching, so a candidate who writes "led a team of 5 people" can be rejected for a job asking for "team management" even though it's the same skill in different words. This vocabulary mismatch filters out qualified candidates and causes recruiters to miss good talent.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
