<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 149 0 R
/E (Weight words by how rare and important they are, which is slightly smarter than raw counting. Still purely word-based, so they have no sense of meaning or context.Common words like "the" get a low weight, while rarer ones like "Kubernetes" get a high one. It only looks at exact words, so "leadership" and "management" count as completely unrelated terms.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
