222 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 149 0 R
/E (BM25 \(Okapi BM25\) is an improved version of TF-IDF, used by search engines like Elasticsearch. It stops repeated words from inflating the score endlessly, which reduces the effect of keyword stuffing, and it adjusts for document length so longer resumes don't get an unfair advantage. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [9]
>>
